3. Vocabulary data

The entries in data/ come from the "Vocabolario milanese-italiano" by
Francesco Cherubini (1839-1856), whose original text is in the public domain.
The selection and digital transcription of the technical entries were made by
Stefano Pilato for his "Voci tecniche" edition. Nothing in this license
restricts the use of Cherubini's original public-domain text.

